    objective: "Be the first player to have four-of-a-kind in all of your books and shout 'James Bond!'.",
    gameplay: "1. Players start simultaneously at the signal 'Go!'.\n2. You may pick up and look at ONE of your books at a time.\n3. **Swapping**: You can swap one card from your book with one card from the Pond. You must place your card face-up in the Pond before taking the new one.\n4. You cannot have more or fewer than 4 cards in your hand/book at any time.\n5. You can put down a book and pick up another at any point to continue swapping.",
